 "summary": "Family of object-oriented Pascal dialects: Apple's Object Pascal (1986), Borland Turbo Pascal 5.5 objects and Delphi classes (1995), and the open-source Free Pascal compiler. Adds units, classes with single inheritance and interfaces, properties, exceptions, generics, managed strings and dynamic arrays to Pascal.",
